  <!-- EN: shields -->
  <ShieldBelt.label>ﺩﺭﻭﻉ</ShieldBelt.label>
  <!-- EN: Build wearable shield gear. Shields use momentum-repulsion technology to prevent projectiles from traversing the field boundary. -->
  <ShieldBelt.description>ﺍﻟﺤﻘﻞ ﺣﺪﻭﺩ ﻋﺒﻮﺭ ﻣﻦ ﺍﻟﻤﻘﺬﻭﻓﺎﺕ. ﻟﻤﻨﻊ ﺍﻟﺰﺧﻢ ﺻﺪّ ﺗﻘﻨﻴﺔ ﺍﻟﺪﺭﻭﻉ ﺗﺴﺘﺨﺪﻡ ﻟﻻﺮﺗﺪﺍﺀ ﻗﺎﺑﻞ ﺩﺭﻉ ﻋﺘﺎﺩ ﺍﺑﻦِ.</ShieldBelt.description>
