  <!-- EN: transport pod -->
  <TransportPod.label>ﻧﻘﻞ ﻛﺒﺴﻮﻻﺕ</TransportPod.label>
  <!-- EN: Construct launchable transport pods that you can use to send people and supplies long distances across the planet's surface. Can be used for raiding, travel, sending gifts, and more. -->
  <TransportPod.description>ﺫﻟﻚ ﻭﻏﻴﺮ ﺍﻟﻬﺪﺍﻳﺎ ﻭﺇﺭﺳﺎﻝ ﻭﺍﻟﺴﻔﺮ ﻟﻠﻐﺎﺭﺍﺕ ﺍﺳﺘﺨﺪﺍﻣﻬﺎ ﻳﻤﻜﻦ ﺍﻟﻜﻮﻛﺐ ﺳﻄﺢ ﻋﺒﺮ ﻃﻮﻳﻠﺔ ﻟﻤﺴﺎﻓﺎﺕ ﻭﺍﻹﻣﺪﺍﺩﺍﺕ ﺍﻷﺷﺨﺎﺹ. ﻹﺭﺳﺎﻝ ﺍﺳﺘﺨﺪﺍﻣﻬﺎ ﻳﻤﻜﻨﻚ ﻟﻹﻄﻻﻖ ﻗﺎﺑﻠﺔ ﻧﻘﻞ ﻛﺒﺴﻮﻻﺕ ﺍﺑﻦِ.</TransportPod.description>
  <!-- EN:
    <li>subject->transport pods</li>
    <li>subject_story->landed a pod in the middle of a feral tribe and barely escaped alive</li>
    <li>subject_story->spent a fortune sending a transport pod to the object of [ANYPAWN_possessive] affection, carrying a single wedding ring</li>
    <li>subject_story->staved off famine through judicious pod deployment</li>
    <li>subject_gerund->constructing transport pods</li>
  -->
  <TransportPod.generalRules.rulesStrings>
    <li>subject->ﻧﻘﻞ ﻛﺒﺴﻮﻻﺕ</li>
    <li>subject_FemMas->ﺍﻟﻨﻘﻞ ﻛﺒﺴﻮﻻﺕ</li>
